1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,176
Ghar ka kharcha badhta ja raha hai, aur main ghar pe baithi hoon.

2
00:00:04,476 --> 00:00:10,978
Sunita beti, tumhare haath ka khana poora mohalla yaad karta hai. Tiffin service shuru karo!

3
00:00:11,278 --> 00:00:13,862
Par khana kharidega kaun, Chacha ji?

4
00:00:14,162 --> 00:00:20,097
Paas ke hostel, PG aur office wale. Shuruaat 15 hazaar mein, tiffin aur bade bartan.

5
00:00:20,397 --> 00:00:27,073
WhatsApp group banao, roz ka menu daalo. Aur FSSAI registration zaroor karana.

6
00:00:27,623 --> 00:00:32,075
Aunty, hostel ka khana khaake tang aa gaya. Mahine ka tiffin laga do!

7
00:00:32,375 --> 00:00:35,960
Daal, sabzi, chaar roti, chawal. Mahine ke 3 hazaar.

8
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:42,810
30 grahak, yaani mahine ke 90 hazaar. Kharcha nikaal kar bhi 35-40 hazaar bachenge.

9
00:00:43,110 --> 00:00:46,753
Grahak badhein, to delivery ke liye ek ladka rakh lena.

10
00:00:47,053 --> 00:00:50,001
Ghar baithe business! Sunita ki life set!
